    "title": "M Cosmetic",
    "description": "Ilovada M Cosmetic bepul virtual kartasini rasmiylashtiring va sevimli tovarlaringizga chegirmalar oling. Ilovada sizga quyidagilar erishimli bo\u2018ladi:\r\n- Karta bo\u2018yicha xaridlar tarixi\r\n-Chegirmalar bilan kuponlar\r\n- Chegirmalar to\u2018g\u2018risida eng dolzarb ma\u2019lumotlar\r\n \r\nM Cosmetic \u2013 kosmetika, parfyumeriya, gigiyenik vositalar, bolalar, uy va hayvonlar uchun keng miqyosdagi tovarlarni taklif qiluvchi do\u2018kon. M Cosmetic-da har kim o\u2018zi va oilasi uchun kerak bo\u2018lgan barcha narsani topadi.\r\n \r\nApply for a free virtual M COSMETIC card in the application and receive discounts on your favorite products. In the application you will have access to:\r\n\u2043 Card purchase history\r\n\u2043 Coupons with discounts\r\n\u2043 The latest information about discounts\r\n\r\nM Cosmetic is a store offering a wide selection of cosmetics, perfumes, hygiene products and products for children, home and animals. At M Cosmetic, everyone will find everything they need for themselves and their family.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ilovada M Cosmetic bepul virtual kartasini rasmiylashtiring va sevimli tovarlaringizga chegirmalar oling. Ilovada sizga quyidagilar erishimli bo\u2018ladi:<br>- Karta bo\u2018yicha xaridlar tarixi<br>-Chegirmalar bilan kuponlar<br>- Chegirmalar to\u2018g\u2018risida eng dolzarb ma\u2019lumotlar<br> <br>M Cosmetic \u2013 kosmetika, parfyumeriya, gigiyenik vositalar, bolalar, uy va hayvonlar uchun keng miqyosdagi tovarlarni taklif qiluvchi do\u2018kon. M Cosmetic-da har kim o\u2018zi va oilasi uchun kerak bo\u2018lgan barcha narsani topadi.<br> <br>Apply for a free virtual M COSMETIC card in the application and receive discounts on your favorite products. In the application you will have access to:<br>\u2043 Card purchase history<br>\u2043 Coupons with discounts<br>\u2043 The latest information about discounts<br><br>M Cosmetic is a store offering a wide selection of cosmetics, perfumes, hygiene products and products for children, home and animals. At M Cosmetic, everyone will find everything they need for themselves and their family.",
